    extendedBio: 'Dr Sarah Alsawy is a multi-award winning expert clinical psychologist, specialist in the field of relationships, family dynamics, and emotional resilience. Her Relational Alignment Protocol is an innovative, evidence-based framework that helps clients transform conflict, disconnection, and emotional distress into safety, trust, and wellbeing. With over 15 years of clinical experience, her clients experience strengthened relationships, improved communication, and increased confidence. Working with executive couples and families, her work is particularly important during significant life transitions, including marriage or separation, addition of new family members, succession planning, and liquidity events.',
